WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.980
The Digital World,

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.040
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.500
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.250
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.040
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:25.660
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:54.490
We arrived in the fifth 
Kingdom, Gold Land.

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:58.340
But this Kingdom's Death General, 
Olegmon the Gold Thief,

00:01:58.340 --> 00:01:59.860
was a troublesome opponent.

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.650
He used a strange incantation 
to lure Shoutmon

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:05.680
and our other Digimon to his 
army, one after another.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.470
Shoutmon returned to us

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:10.610
thanks to Ballistamon, 
but it was only a moment's relief.

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:12.640
Because then we learned 
something unbelievable...

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:16.680
He was one of my men to start with.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:18.150
I made him!

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.850
Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.660
Ballistamon was...

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.730
...an enemy?

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:32.100
That... That can't be...

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.990
Oh, yes, it can.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:36.970
It's a happy reunion 
surpassing space and time!

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.720
Now, reawaken!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:42.210
The ultimate destructive weapon 
that amplifies my power,

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:43.470
DarkVolumon!

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:49.310
Ballistamon!

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:58.340
<b>Olegmon the Gold Thief Laughs!</b>

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:58.340
<b>Farewell, Xros Heart!</b>

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:56.770
Olegmon the Gold Thief Laughs! 
Farewell, Xros Heart!

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:03.010
It can't be... Ballistamon is our enemy?

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:03.800
You're lying!

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.530
It's true.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:08.000
When this world still had Zones,

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:13.470
he was a superweapon I created 
myself in the Gold Zone.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.960
But he was too powerful,

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.240
so when I experimentally started 
him up, space-time was warped,

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.320
and he was thrown to 
the ends of the world.

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:23.110
Someone there reassembled his circuits,

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:25.480
and it seems he forgot his orders.

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.000
<i>There.</i>

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.240
<i>Perfect!</i>

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.570
<i>Here we go!</i>

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.610
<i>This is awesome! What a great feeling!</i>

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:57.190
<i>Shoutmon, I owe you my life.</i>

00:03:57.190 --> 00:03:59.080
<i>You saved me.</i>

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:00.630
<i>No problem!</i>

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.630
<i>Your appearance might be a little 
different from before, though.</i>

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:07.170
<i>It's okay. I don't remember 
anything from before, anyway.</i>

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:09.770
<i>This new body is what I am now.</i>

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.010
<i>Really?</i>

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.250
<i>Oh, yeah!</i>

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:15.970
<i>What do you think of Ballistamon 
for your new name?</i>

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:17.870
<i>Ballista...</i>

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.540
<i>As in, "ballistic."</i>

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.580
<i>I'm quick to fight,</i>

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:25.650
<i>so Jijimon always gets mad 
and calls me a loose cannon.</i>

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:29.510
<i>I want you to be my 
partner and back me up.</i>

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:31.280
<i>That might be a good idea!</i>

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:33.540
<i>It'll put me at ease 
knowing there's someone</i>

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.450
<i>keeping an eye on Shoutmon.</i>

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.850
<i>Oh, shut up!</i>

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:39.220
<i>Ballistamon.</i>

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:40.830
<i>That's a great name.</i>

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:44.210
<i>I will be your partner.</i>

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:46.720
<i>That's right...</i>

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.900
<i>I was the one who 
reassembled his circuits!</i>

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.270
<i>So Ballistamon really was...</i>

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.160
All right, now, who are you?

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.400
DarkVolumon.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:01.600
The destroyer of the world, 
created by Lord Olegmon.

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:04.990
Welcome home, my treasure.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:08.350
Now, take Taiki Kudou!

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:10.090
Understood.

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:15.030
Stop this, Ballistamon!

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.140
Who are you?

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:18.860
Move!

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:26.340
You can't say you forgot me! 
Don't joke around!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.280
He is Olegmon's secret weapon.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:33.410
MailBirdramon! Deckerdramon!

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:34.390
Attack!

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.080
Right!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:37.750
Wait! He's...

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:39.450
Stop it, Ballistamon!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.720
I am DarkVolumon!

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:46.160
This... This can't be happening!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:50.290
How sad to see a friendship broken.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:54.900
I, Lord Olegmon, will put 
an end to your tragedy!

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:01.870
The Captain's shoulders are opening!

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.250
M-Monsters?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:15.320
Yes! I am the merry demon of 
his left shoulder, Surtr!

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:22.960
I am the melancholy demon of his 
right shoulder, Jörmungandr.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:26.500
Help them out, Surtr.

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:27.700
Yes! I am Surtr!

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:31.440
Hey, boys! Tell me what you wish for!

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:34.170
I will grant only one! Come on!

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:35.940
How dare you joke around!

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:39.580
Our only wish is to defeat Olegmon!

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:41.890
All right, I will grant your wish.

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:46.190
In other words, you wish for 
a world without me in it.

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:47.680
Got that, Surtr?

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:48.640
Okay!

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:50.770
Then you should all disappear 
to the ends of the world!

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.190
Fly away!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:01.430
You, too! Disappear!

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:08.110
B-Ballistamon!

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.260
See how compassionate I am?

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.690
That's our Captain! I'm moved to tears!

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:19.490
Viva Captain! Gappo, Gappo!

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:22.090
Shoutmon! Kiriha!

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.730
Where are we?

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:35.700
I can't see land anywhere!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.080
Gappo, Gappo!

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:54.810
Isn't this fun, Taiki?

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:57.510
The Gold Thief Army has 
fun like this every day.

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:00.530
Yeah! Come have fun with us, Taiki!

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:02.540
Let's bust a move!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.460
You said it! Gappo, Gappo!

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:08.640
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:10.200
Everyone...

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:11.980
You can invite me all you want,

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:14.210
but I'll never follow you!

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:17.110
My incantation only works on Digimon.

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:19.240
You have to make the decision yourself.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.380
Come on, Taiki.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:24.970
I've been trying so hard to win you,

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:26.860
out of all you three humans.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.820
Why do you want me more 
than Kiriha and Nene?

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:33.550
You understand better than anyone 
how important friendship is.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:35.090
Friends are treasure.

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:38.900
Gappo, Gappo!

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:41.540
You're right. Friends are treasure.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:45.480
I know you're different from the 
other Death Generals we've met.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:50.190
You value friends. You want more 
friends. I don't think that's a lie.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:51.830
Oh, so you understand!

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.440
Here! Eat! Drink!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:56.780
But I won't forget what 
you did to Ballistamon!

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.650
Even if you did create him,

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:00.770
I won't approve of anyone who 
tears apart his friendships

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:02.450
without a second thought!

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:04.090
Is that so?

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:09.790
Then I'll have to be cruel.

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:13.530
I am a bad guy at heart, after all.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.040
Nene!

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.200
Taiki!

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:22.310
Snuck in here trying 
to rescue him, did you?

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:24.030
What a ladies' man this boy is!

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:26.060
See? If you don't join my army,

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.870
terrible things will happen 
to your girlfriend!

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:31.600
Sh-She's not my girlfriend!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:35.020
Don't take this lightly. 
Terrible things really will happen.

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:38.410
She's the target of my newly recovered

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.790
DarkVolumon's ultrasonic 
weapon, you know.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:47.930
It'll blow her away like fog.

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:55.490
The Ultimate Speaker has been restored.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:59.750
Tomorrow will be our experiment to 
power you up again, against a human.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:00.780
You can do it, right?

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:07.720
Of course I can. I'm DarkVolumon, 
Lord Olegmon's servant.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:16.380
We've been sent really far away, huh?

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:20.730
And there are so few of us. 
We might not stand a chance.

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:24.060
We still have our pride.

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.970
Right, Dracomon?

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:26.970
Yeah!

00:10:26.970 --> 00:10:28.840
Sorry, Kiriha.

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:31.770
This is when we really 
need your strength.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.000
Look at this.

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:36.610
Shoutmon?

00:10:38.390 --> 00:10:39.350
Kiriha...

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:43.820
What? I don't have time to 
listen to you crying right now.

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.200
Let me fight with you, Kiriha!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.190
Please!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.970
Just so you're aware...

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:53.770
We're planning to destroy 
your best friend.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:57.550
DarkVolumon is the enemy's 
trump card right now.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.340
That's not his name!

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:01.360
He's Ballistamon!

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.640
He has been since the 
moment I saved him!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:07.450
Kiriha, we must work together.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:10.980
Give some consideration to 
Shoutmon's concern for his friend.

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:14.490
We need as many allies as we can get.

00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:24.900
I'm not like Taiki.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.700
I might use you and 
discard you like a pawn.

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.030
That's fine with me! Thank you!

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:33.140
Leave Ballistamon to me!

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:35.900
This time, I'll bring 
him back to his senses!

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.730
Then it's settled.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.860
Stop this! Let Nene go!

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:58.760
Now then,

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:01.630
let's begin our experiment 
with the Ultimate Speaker.

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:04.700
Don't blow it this time, DarkVolumon.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.250
Understood.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:10.310
Start with level one. Gappo!

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:12.210
Gappo!

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:15.710
Nene!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:17.820
How's that for power?!

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:19.680
Through DarkVolumon,

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:22.590
my incantation becomes a 
destructive sound wave!

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.450
I look forward to seeing how 
much this weak little human

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:27.590
can withstand!

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.060
Stop! Please stop!

00:12:29.610 --> 00:12:33.430
Then swear you'll join my army!

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.420
Don't do it, Taiki!

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:37.740
I can handle this!

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.800
Time for level two!

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:42.570
Gappo, Gappo!

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:43.940
Gappo, Gappo!

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.110
Gappo, Gappo!

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:48.880
Nene!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.310
Level three will kill her.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:54.270
Don't be unreasonable, Taiki.

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:55.850
Become one of us.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.560
Yeah! Yeah! Gappo, Gappo!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.120
Well, Taiki?

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:16.110
You just lost your last chance from me!

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.380
Level three!

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:20.510
Wait! Stop!

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:24.660
Gappo, Gappo!

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.480
Shut up, you creep!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.170
Thanks, MailBirdramon!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.450
Why, you!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.710
I'm here to save you, Ballistamon!

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:49.840
I am DarkVolumon!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:50.990
No, you're not!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.580
Oh, no! We have to help them!

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:58.030
It's best not to get too close.

00:13:58.030 --> 00:13:58.840
What?

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:00.590
He's right.

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:02.420
Are you a good swimmer, Taiki?

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.170
Huh? Well, average, I guess...

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:05.360
Glad to hear it.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:08.060
Reload, Deckerdramon!

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:14.980
Now I get it!

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:20.950
Now there's no need to 
worry about our teammates.

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:23.940
I figured out where the 
ship's weak point was.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.410
You're the best, Dracomon!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:29.360
Counterattack!

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:35.780
Hold still!

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:39.720
I... I think I was...

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:42.790
No! I am DarkVolumon!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.430
I always have been!

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:47.310
I was born a weapon of destruction!

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.180
I keep telling you, you're wrong!

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:57.080
Thanks, Surtr and Jörmungandr.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.740
I know I'm heavy.

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.600
Take vengeance.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:04.050
Yeah, yeah! Vengeance, vengeance!

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.980
Keep your hands off my partner!

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:10.240
Dual Tomahawk Boomerang!

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:13.460
Taiki, DigiXros us!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:14.790
What?!

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:17.710
Hurry up! It's sink or swim!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:20.430
I'll call out to Ballistamon's heart!

00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:21.600
All right!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.830
DigiXros!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.220
There he is! Ballistamon!

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:42.520
Leave me, Shoutmon.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.420
Are you crying?

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.990
It was only a fluke that 
I became a good Digimon.

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:54.300
I'm really just an evil weapon 
created for a terrible purpose.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.380
I realize it now.

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:59.540
So don't bother with me anymore.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.530
It wasn't a fluke!

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:06.840
I knew from the moment I saw 
you that I had to save you.

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.750
You're my destined partner!

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:13.450
It was your destiny to be 
reborn as a good guy, too!

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:15.820
Tell me how you really feel!

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:20.670
Which do you like more, who you 
were before I saved you, or after?

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:22.730
Which... do I like?

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:28.100
Whichever one it is, I'll protect 
your choice with my life!

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:30.800
Come on, tell me, Ballistamon!

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:34.150
Shoutmon...

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.830
That's it. Now, we 
counterattack, DarkVolumon!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.740
At max level!

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:46.250
Aim for that flying fool.

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.550
We'll show them what they 
get for making a fool of me,

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:49.790
by crushing them to dust!

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:53.560
MailBirdramon, Nene! Run!

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:55.040
Take this!

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:58.500
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:01.700
Ballistamon!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.280
What happened? Another breakdown?

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:11.680
Hurry it up! Gappo, Gappo!

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:15.510
I hate those words!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.560
What?!

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:25.840
I like the me that Shoutmon fixed.

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:28.990
The reborn me is who I really am.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:30.800
Ballistamon!

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:33.330
I love that name.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:35.600
I am Ballistamon!

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:37.870
Ballistamon!

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.270
Yes!

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:41.210
Ballistamon is back!

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:44.530
Shoutmon, I've realized my own strength.

00:17:44.530 --> 00:17:47.060
Call to everyone with my speaker.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:48.050
Right!

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:51.020
Xros Heart! Old man Greymon!

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:54.230
All of you, wake up!

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:55.990
Wake up!

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:00.560
What were we doing?

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:05.830
I feel like I've been running amock 
again, but I can't remember a thing!

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:07.630
Now! Taiki, Nene!

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:08.270
Yeah!

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.900
Shoutmon! Ballistamon! 
Dorulumon! Starmons! Spadamon!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.710
Mervamon! Sparrowmon!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:15.620
Greymon! MailBirdramon!

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:17.610
Okay!

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:20.430
Yes!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:28.420
DigiXros!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.020
DigiXros!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:37.130
Shoutmon X4S!

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:42.400
MetalGreymon!

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:45.900
JetMervamon!

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:49.290
Giga Destroyer!

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.460
Spicy Hard Love!

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:03.260
Even if you win your friends back,

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:06.390
you could never match my 
strength in the first place!

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:09.110
Viking Vuffet!

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:14.870
C-Captain!

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:16.510
Mermaimon!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.320
I will never forgive you brats!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:25.480
Shall we help him?

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:27.850
I won't forgive you! 
I won't forgive you!

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.450
We'll make that wish come true, baby!

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:33.450
Hi! I'm Surtr!

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:40.970
Hey, hey, hey!

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:43.510
Hit him with my ultimate 
darkness attack at its

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:46.120
fullest destructive shadow power!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:50.030
I will send you to a world from 
which you can never return.

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:52.640
Disappear to the ends of space and time!

00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:56.250
I won't let you do that!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.680
I will protect my friends,

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:59.440
with my own power!

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:00.970
What?!

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:09.300
Ultimate Speaker!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:13.100
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:16.660
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:16.660
Th-That sound...

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:21.430
Gappo, Gappo! Viva Olegna!

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:21.430
It's my voice, from before!

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:24.120
It was still in his body?

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.240
Way to go, Ballistamon!

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:32.810
Well, I've lost.

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:36.150
I never thought I'd be 
defeated by my own voice.

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:40.080
Bonds of friendship are powerful.

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.220
I suppose it couldn't be helped.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:46.150
Olegmon,

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:49.450
you really weren't like the 
other Death Generals.

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.700
If only we hadn't met as enemies...

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:54.280
Now, you're gonna make me cry.

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:56.400
You've won me over yet again, Taiki.

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:58.730
Good luck to you.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.670
Friends are a treasure. 
Take care of them.

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:09.570
You were a tough opponent, 
but a good sport in the end.

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:11.220
I will give you that much.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:20.630
Finally, the ship is upright again!

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:24.030
Yeah. From now on, it belongs to us.

00:21:24.030 --> 00:21:27.370
We'll use it to travel around 
this Kingdom and help everyone.

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:29.170
You do your best, too, Shoutmon.

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:30.530
I will!

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:33.000
Still, I don't remember a 
thing that happened while I

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.460
was under Olegmon's control.

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:35.590
Oh, really?

00:21:35.590 --> 00:21:36.940
Why the scary look?

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:40.650
We remember perfectly! Right?

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:43.610
We remember perfectly! Right?

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:47.950
Okay, we're setting sail!

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:52.110
All right! On to the next Kingdom!

